# (build 97c) Motavia's map by flag (loc_9258, loc_9302; the port's
# level_map_patches). The same place three times, each by a warp that
# reloads the level: as the game starts; with Climatrol destroyed
# ($C735) alone -- every block $8B (dry orange ground) becomes $89
# (water), and four more cells with it, none of them here; and with all
# four dams' panels opened ($C72F blue, $C733 red, $C731 yellow, $C72D
# green) -- each panel's table lays water ($87) in runs, across or down,
# and its edge and grass-corner blocks ($92-$95, $A6-$A9) one at a time:
# the empty canals fill. Blocks 55,47 to 64,53 are where the dams'
# tables change the most (27 of their 413 blocks); the party stands at
# 120,101.
#
# For checking against the emulator: the three shots, and a save there
# with $C735 and the panels set shows the third.

start slot 1 routes/saves/jet_scooter.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 89 116
warp 0 120 101
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 01_before
flag $C735 1
warp 0 120 101
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 02_climatrol_destroyed
flag $C72F 1
flag $C733 1
flag $C731 1
flag $C72D 1
warp 0 120 101
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 03_dams_opened
